# cafe-launcher-avalonia
===
 A community-made third-party desktop launcher for the Japanese version of Blue Archive. Built using .NET 10 and Avalonia, it consolidates installation, updating, repair, launching, and uninstallation into a single window and is directly compatible with game directories already downloaded by the official launcher.
